ld>Notes:</bold> Semiquantitative rating of signs and symptoms: &#x02212; = absent; &#x02212;/+ = minimal/rare; + = mild/infrequent; ++ = moderate/frequent; +++ = severe/most frequent.</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-opth-1-37"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> CK, creatine kinase; DM1, myotonic dystrophy type 1; Ocular MG, ocular myasthenia gravis; OM, ocular myositis; OPMD, oculopharygeal muscular dystrophy; PEO, progressive external ophthalmoplegia; TED, thyroid eye disease.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>